            <div className="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-slate-800 pb-3.5">
              <h3 className="font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 text-base"><Sparkles size={20} className="text-amber-400"/> AI 추천 가격 상세 검토 (10/09 Deluxe Room)</h3>
