        {/* 대시보드 메인 본문 (스크롤 가능, 가독성 향상을 위한 여백 및 폰트 조정) */}
        <div className="flex-1 p-5 flex flex-col gap-5 overflow-y-auto bg-slate-950">
          
          {activeMenu === '대시보드' && (
            <div className="flex-1 flex flex-col gap-5">
              
              {/* 상단 5개 요약 카드 (폰트 크기 확대 및 인터랙티브 기능 강화) */}
              <div className="grid grid-cols-5 gap-4 shrink-0">
                {/* 1. 예상 매출 */}
                <div onClick={() => setActiveModal('revenue')} className="bg-slate-900 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 cursor-pointer hover:border-emerald-500/60 transition-all shadow-lg group">
                  <div className="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1.5 font-semibold flex items-center justify-between"><span className="flex items-center gap-1.5"><DollarSign size={15} className="text-emerald-400"/> 예상 매출</span><ExternalLink size={13} className="text-slate-500 group-hover:text-emerald-400" /></div>
                  <div className="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">138,287,500원</div>
                  <div className="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-bold mt-2 flex items-center gap-1"><TrendingUp size={13}/> ▲ 11.8% (AI 적용 시)</div>
                </div>
                {/* 2. 오늘 예상 ADR */}
                <div className="bg-slate-900 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 shadow-lg">
                  <div className="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1.5 font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5"><TagIcon size={15} className="text-blue-400"/> 오늘 예상 ADR</div>
                  <div className="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">1,083,000원</div>
                  <div className="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-bold mt-2 flex items-center gap-1"><TrendingUp size={13}/> ▲ 7.2% 상승</div>
                </div>
                {/* 3. 예상 OCC */}
                <div onClick={() => setActiveModal('occ')} className="bg-slate-900 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 cursor-pointer hover:border-purple-500/60 transition-all shadow-lg group">
                  <div className="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1.5 font-semibold flex items-center justify-between"><span className="flex items-center gap-1.5"><PieChart size={15} className="text-purple-400"/> 예상 OCC</span><ExternalLink size={13} className="text-slate-500 group-hover:text-purple-400" /></div>
                  <div className="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">76%</div>
                  <div className="text-xs text-rose-400 font-bold mt-2 flex items-center gap-1">▼ 0.8%p 변동</div>
                </div>
                {/* 4. RevPAR */}
                <div className="bg-slate-900 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 shadow-lg">
                  <div className="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1.5 font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5"><Zap size={15} className="text-amber-400"/> RevPAR</div>
                  <div className="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">823,000원</div>
                  <div className="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-bold mt-2 flex items-center gap-1"><TrendingUp size={13}/> ▲ 6.1% 성장</div>
                </div>
                {/* 5. AI 적용 전/후 효과 */}
                <div className="bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-950/80 to-slate-900 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-500/40 shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
                  <div className="text-xs text-indigo-300 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5"><Sparkles size={14} className="text-amber-400"/> AI 적용 전/후 효과</div>
                  <div className="grid grid-cols-4 gap-1 text-[11px] text-center my-2 font-medium">
                    <div><div className="text-slate-400 text-[10px]">매출</div><div className="font-bold text-emerald-400">+11.8M</div></div>
                    <div><div className="text-slate-400 text-[10px]">ADR</div><div className="font-bold text-emerald-400">+7.2%</div></div>
                    <div><div className="text-slate-400 text-[10px]">OCC</div><div className="font-bold text-rose-400">-0.8%</div></div>
                    <div><div className="text-slate-400 text-[10px]">RevPAR</div><div className="font-bold text-emerald-400">+6.1%</div></div>
                  </div>
                  <div className="text-[10px] text-slate-400 text-right">실시간 최적화 구동중</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              {/* 중앙 메인 콘텐츠 그리드 (좌측: 다이내믹 프라이싱 현황 차트 / 우측: AI 추천 가격 카드) */}
              <div className="grid grid-cols-12 gap-5">
                
                {/* 좌측: 객실 타입별 다이내믹 프라이싱 현황 (선 그래프 영역) */}
                <div className="col-span-8 bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 p-6 flex flex-col shadow-xl">
                  <div className="flex justify-between items-center mb-5">
                    <div className="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                      <h2 className="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide">객실 타입별 다이내믹 프라이싱 현황</h2>
                      <HelpCircle size={16} className="text-slate-400 cursor-pointer hover:text-white" />
                    </div>
                    {/* 객실 필터 체크박스 범례 (클릭 시 토글 기능 연동) */}
                    <div className="flex items-center gap-5 text-xs font-semibold">
                      <label className="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer text-cyan-300 hover:text-cyan-200">
                        <input type="checkbox" checked={roomFilters.deluxe} onChange={() => { setRoomFilters({...roomFilters, deluxe: !roomFilters.deluxe}); showToast('Deluxe Room 차트 표시 여부가 변경되었습니다.'); }} className="accent-cyan-400 rounded w-4 h-4" /> Deluxe Room
                      </label>
                      <label className="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer text-red-400 hover:text-red-300">
                        <input type="checkbox" checked={roomFilters.junior} onChange={() => { setRoomFilters({...roomFilters, junior: !roomFilters.junior}); showToast('Junior Suite 차트 표시 여부가 변경되었습니다.'); }} className="accent-red-400 rounded w-4 h-4" /> Junior Suite
                      </label>
                      <label className="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300">
                        <input type="checkbox" checked={roomFilters.classicRoom} onChange={() => { setRoomFilters({...roomFilters, classicRoom: !roomFilters.classicRoom}); showToast('Classic Room 차트 표시 여부가 변경되었습니다.'); }} className="accent-sky-400 rounded w-4 h-4" /> Classic Room
                      </label>
                      <label className="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer text-white hover:text-slate-200">
                        <input type="checkbox" checked={roomFilters.classicSuite} onChange={() => { setRoomFilters({...roomFilters, classicSuite: !roomFilters.classicSuite}); showToast('Classic Suite 차트 표시 여부가 변경되었습니다.'); }} className="accent-white rounded w-4 h-4" /> Classic Suite
                      </label>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  {/* 세련된 선 그래프 컨테이너 */}
                  <div 
